            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI strangely both like it (it looks as interesting usability feature) and don't really like it (might look \"too magical\" and would require extra complexity in `reveal_cwd()` function which would not 100% justify its name). I'll think about it.",
